WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.160
Three seconds: just enough time

2
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:04.360
for people to judge you from head to toe,

3
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:05.860
based on your image alone.

4
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:07.860
Before you speak, before you say a word,

5
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:09.760
you could be losing business,

6
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:11.060
losing clients

7
00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:12.560
or missing opportunities

8
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:15.160
because your image isn't aligned.

9
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.460
Your client doesn't just buy a product or service:

10
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:19.960
they buy what your image conveys,

11
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:21.860
before you say a single word.

12
00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:24.060
That's why it matters to adjust the lens

13
00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:26.660
between what your client expects from a successful man

14
00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:29.760
and who you truly are, at your core.

15
00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:31.960
How do you expect, with the image you have today,

16
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.360
to convince the world

17
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.760
that you're truly good at what you do?

18
00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:38.460
You can have the technique, the attitude,

19
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:39.460
the mindset,

20
00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:41.360
but if your image doesn't express

21
00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:43.960
the identity you've built over the years,

22
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:44.960
you won't convince anyone.

23
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:46.860
That's where I come in.

24
00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:48.460
I can help you find,

25
00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:50.160
through my visagism consultation,

26
00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:51.860
the image you're looking for.

27
00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:53.260
One video call.

28
00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:56.160
We'll find out what you really need.

29
00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:56.860
What do you like?

30
00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:58.860
What don't you like about your hair and beard?

31
00:00:58.900 --> 00:01:00.360
We'll do a facial analysis,

32
00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:01.960
a complete diagnosis.

33
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.660
I'll propose an image project

34
00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:05.260
for your barber to carry out

35
00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:06.660
right there in your city.

36
00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:08.860
Your image can't be a copy,

37
00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:10.060
it has to be yours.

38
00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:11.760
The best investment you can make

39
00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:12.660
is in yourself.

40
00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:14.460
Your image is your most important asset

41
00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:16.160
to tell the world

42
00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:18.660
what you truly want to say.

43
00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:21.100
Here's the link. See you on the call.
